      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Groveton%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The soil along the Connecticut River in Groveton is highly productive, free of stone and gravel, and was originally covered with butternut trees.",
